{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/extras/98bfc5bed5b6e552bbb110d93efe0b85.poster.avif?t=1771232459\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/extras/98bfc5bed5b6e552bbb110d93efe0b85.webm?t=1771232459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/extras/98bfc5bed5b6e552bbb110d93efe0b85.mp4?t=1771232459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person horror is the basis of the gameplay of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Non-linear plot with three endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exciting hunger mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shooter mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player mode will immerse you in the atmosphere of a post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Passing time from 40 minutes and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has only checkpoints, which are destroyed when the game is turned off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random spawning of individual quest items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character wakes up in his house and lives an ordinary life of a person who survived the end of humanity. Helps his friends, goes hunting and repairs equipment. The main character is an unusual person, he has abilities that help him survive in poisonous spores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to help the main character's friends, update the filters in their houses, solving the problems of other acquaintances along the way. But be prepared to face monsters and obstacles that will stand in your way. Or, in spite of everything, abandon your affairs and join a mysterious cult that calls itself Atonement and wants to destroy all of humanity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dark atmosphere and anticipation of horror will haunt you throughout the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802920?t=1771232459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802920?t=1771232459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/8cd912f31a24ad7abc69219886ebd136b6654513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771232459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/8cd912f31a24ad7abc69219886ebd136b6654513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771232459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has death scenes and screamers."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/extras/98bfc5bed5b6e552bbb110d93efe0b85.poster.avif?t=1771232459\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/extras/98bfc5bed5b6e552bbb110d93efe0b85.webm?t=1771232459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/extras/98bfc5bed5b6e552bbb110d93efe0b85.mp4?t=1771232459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- First-person horror is the basis of the gameplay of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Non-linear plot with three endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Exciting hunger mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shooter mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player mode will immerse you in the atmosphere of a post-apocalyptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Passing time from 40 minutes and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has only checkpoints, which are destroyed when the game is turned off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random spawning of individual quest items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character wakes up in his house and lives an ordinary life of a person who survived the end of humanity. Helps his friends, goes hunting and repairs equipment. The main character is an unusual person, he has abilities that help him survive in poisonous spores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to help the main character's friends, update the filters in their houses, solving the problems of other acquaintances along the way. But be prepared to face monsters and obstacles that will stand in your way. Or, in spite of everything, abandon your affairs and join a mysterious cult that calls itself Atonement and wants to destroy all of humanity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dark atmosphere and anticipation of horror will haunt you throughout the game.</p>","developers":["Yevhen Shkurko"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802920/010b1ee3457403b173e32a1350434197f3a52b8c/header.jpg?t=1771232459","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3802920/2145942069/1e290c5c964245e6b9f2ea282b8e0ca375b73b0f/1771071817/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771232252","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3802920/2145942069/1e290c5c964245e6b9f2ea282b8e0ca375b73b0f/1771071817/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771232252","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3802920/2145942069/1e290c5c964245e6b9f2ea282b8e0ca375b73b0f/1771071817/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771232252","id":257287196,"name":"Burdock /Getting the quest","thumbnail":"http